# Truth-joined tables. This repository deliberately tracks no file carrying
# truth_allele columns: only the truth-free registry and the checksum manifest
# under truth_manifests/ are releasable. The joined table is regenerated from
# the frozen predictions and the truth table by join_truth_once.
artifacts/**/joined*.tsv

# Specimen-level FIMM tables. The workbook is patient material: the normalized calls and
# the per-subject consensus carry FH_/FHRB_ specimen and donor identifiers, so only the
# aggregates under artifacts/ are releasable. Both are regenerated by
# scripts/import_fimm_caller_predictions.py and scripts/summarise_cohort_consensus.py.
data/fimm/
artifacts/**/consensus_calls.SECURE.tsv
